jobs.prompt:
Clean up old Hermes Agent cron job output files. Trim cron output directories older than 7 days: find ~/.hermes/cron/output/ -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 -type d -mtime +7 -exec rm -rf {} \;
Then check total size remaining: du -sh ~/.hermes/cron/output/
Report the result: how many directories were cleaned, how much space recovered, and the current total size.
